.\n66. ↑ Shuster, Simon (October 21, 2020). \"Exclusive: Alleged Hunter Biden Emails Circulated in Ukraine as Rudy Giuliani Dug for Dirt There Last Year\". *TIME*. Archived from the original on October 21, 2020. Retrieved June 29, 2025.\n67. ↑ Blauner, McCaffrey (June 1, 2021). \"Accused Russian Agent Says Giuliani Was 'Very Useful'\". *The Daily Beast*. Retrieved June 9, 2024.\n68. ↑ Shuster, Simon (October 21, 2020). \"Exclusive: Alleged Hunter Biden Emails Circulated in Ukraine as Rudy Giuliani Dug for Dirt There Last Year\". *Time*. Archived from the original on October 21, 2020. Retrieved October 22, 2020.\n69. ↑ \"Security Service says Russia's intelligence recruited Ukrainian MP Derkach\". *The Kyiv Independent*. June 24, 2022. Archived from the original on October 4, 2022. Retrieved December 17, 2022.\n70. ↑ \"The SBU exposed the intelligence network of the GRU of the Russian Federation, which included the People's Deputy of Ukraine\". *The Odessa Journal*. June 25, 2022. Archived from the original on October 2, 2022. Retrieved December 17, 2022.\n71. ↑ Bertrand, Natasha (October 24, 2020). \"Former Giuliani associate raises questions about Hunter Biden's 'hard drive from hell'\". *Politico*. Archived from the original on October 24, 2020. Retrieved October 24, 2020.\n72. ↑ Smith, Ben (October 25, 2020). \"Trump Had One Last Story to Sell. The Wall Street Journal Wouldn't Buy It\". *The New York Times*.\n73. 1 2 Smith, Ben (October 25, 2020). \"Trump Had One Last Story to Sell. The Wall Street Journal Wouldn't Buy It\". *The New York Times*. ISSN 0362-4331. Archived from the original on October 30, 2020. Retrieved October 31, 2020.\n74. ↑ Rashbaum, William K.; Protess, Ben; Vogel, Kenneth P.; Hong, Nicole (May 27, 2021). \"Prosecutors Investigating Whether Ukrainians Meddled in 2020 Election\". *The New York Times*. Archived from the original on June 12, 2021. Retrieved June 12, 2021.\n75. 1 2 Winter, Tom; Fitzpatrick, Sarah; Atkins, Chloe; Strickler, Laura 